            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Scriberman 1.1.5</h2>
<h3>What’s new</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Connect Tinycast and similar apps on your Mac to control recordings, including starting from calendar suggestions.</li>
  <li>Use connected apps to import audio, search sessions, read transcripts, export transcripts, and run saved AI prompts.</li>
  <li>Approve app connections and remove their access in Settings.</li>
</ul>
